Package: golemeurostat
Title: Eurostat Indicators Explorer
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Dimitrios", "Zacharatos", , "dzacharatos@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1789-8294"))
Description: A 'shiny' application, built as a 'golem' package, for exploring
    indicators of 'Eurostat', the statistical office of the European Union,
    for the countries of the EU and EFTA and the candidate countries, and for
    the regions of Europe: country comparison, a ranked bar chart race, maps
    of the countries and of the regions, and a scatter plot. The data are downloaded from the 'Eurostat' API when first needed
    and kept on disk for a day.
